<title>USA: Norwest Corp sells $200 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Norwest Corp sells $200 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Norwest Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER NORWEST CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.55 PCT   MATURITY 12/1/06</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 6/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD 6.55 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  SPREAD 45.6 BPS   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
